  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "STRYDER"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Tell me, Ranger… what is an F-150?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep13/v04.wav",
   "d": 2.925,
   "e": "000rzxwszzxtxjbyzxwutw8txrawr5ke40000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "DAISY"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DAISY",
   "text": "A tool.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep13/v06.wav",
   "d": 1.325,
   "e": "000000cp09gbyzzzzywurolb0000000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "And is a tool good… because it is a tool— or because it performs its function well?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep13/v07.wav",
   "d": 5.275,
   "e": "0lyxlrzuzxb0rvzzumzzsxturrmytmtqtrrb0000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "It sounds like conversation. It is really a way to settle who ranks higher, without saying so.",
   "see": [
    "two people talking beside a truck"
   ],
   "mood": "playful and comic",
   "wav": "pilot/ep13/v08.wav",
   "d": 6.75,
   "e": "0wpzwvvxtysm00yzzwxurwxywkxu0wzmyxsse000",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/421b247c-8155-5d78-8c73-ad0fa8c88a8c/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/dc7043b1-0df9-5915-a615-025d6a408efb.mp4",
     "in": 3.0,
     "dur": 30.3,
     "src": "Highway Haulage Truck Inspection Conducted by MSHA Inspectors",
     "y": 2004,
     "q": "two people talking beside a truck",
     "fit": 0.3
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DAISY",
   "text": "It is good because it performs its function well.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep13/v09.wav",
   "d": 3.225,
   "e": "00byzldzzrtnusrolrxtqdhunjsrsokb00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Then define its function.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep13/v10.wav",
   "d": 1.825,
   "e": "00000vwxw9zzyxxfl4vzvtjoprkha00000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DAISY",
   "text": "Its function is to carry. To tow. To endure. To be ready.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep13/v11.wav",
   "d": 4.05,
   "e": "00ofzuwzpocxuqf0pkzzrtysxyrkvtupi0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Ready for what?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep13/v12.wav",
   "d": 1.375,
   "e": "000000fxzzwxrefzyuyzxtnc0fd0000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DAISY",
   "text": "For anything.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep13/v13.wav",
   "d": 1.475,
   "e": "000000gwutyzzzv50uvusqqoj300000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "that's how he courted me, he argued with me",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/248a05a4-07fd-5027-bff4-5183a60fe92d/v5-windowed-clip-split-1/clips/87998fad-88ac-5c65-85e2-919a90faf88a.mp4",
   "in": 26.64,
   "d": 2.81,
   "said": "Maybe he had more of a personal interest to me.",
   "src": "Hired!",
   "y": 1940
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "A worker pushing a cart glances at them and keeps walking. The Ranger takes out a gauge and measures the truck's clearance, as if measuring its worth.",
   "see": [
    "a worker pushing a cart",
    "a man measuring a truck tire"
   ],
   "wav": "pilot/ep13/v15.wav",
   "d": 10.25,
   "e": "0zwvvvqxvvpwvun0rzuvxwrozvtrxqeuwywtvf00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/4231a1a1-926c-5c32-ab9f-74148ebf50c6/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/9271a320-10fb-55b3-a0eb-798e79734765.mp4",
     "in": 2.0,
     "dur": 12.01,
     "src": "Fire! Patty Learns What to Do",
     "y": 1951,
